WEBVTT

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:17.040
Do you know how to do it, Ret?

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:21.250
How to hold hands like an adult?

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.410
Uh-uh.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:25.040
Not like this.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:31.080
They do it like this.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:36.410
This is how adult lovers hold hands.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:39.700
Hoshino

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.870
I-I get it, so cut it out!

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:51.160
What are you embarrassed about, Ret?

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.290
That was just practice.

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:56.290
Practice? For what?

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:58.870
That's a secret.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:02.450
Wh-What the heck?

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:08.910
That day, for the first time in my life,
I wanted to become a hero.

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:14.870
Five years later...

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:26.040
Super HxEros!

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:26.580
"EPISODE ONE
IN THIS WORLD FULL OF LIGHT"

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:30.500
"EPISODE ONE
IN THIS WORLD FULL OF LIGHT"
Episode One: In This World Full of Light!

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:35.750
Hey. Retto, what do you think?

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:38.290
About what, Date?

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:40.040
The uproar.

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:41.120
Uproar?

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:45.580
Those aliens or superhumans or perverts
or whatever who keep popping up.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:51.540
If it's all true,
it's kind of interesting.

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:53.700
Which one do you like, Torikoe?

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:55.040
Maybe this one.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.040
You asked, but you're
not even listening to my answer?

00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:58.450
Hey, what about you, Retto?

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:00.830
I-I'd rather not.

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:04.250
--Oh, come on!
--You never play along.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.750
This is not a suitable topic for school.

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.660
Sheesh! Listen to them.

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:11.160
Why are boys like that?

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:12.830
What creeps!

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:20.950
That's enough of this!

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:24.370
Can't you tell that you're
making the girls uncomfortable?

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.120
If your minds
are going to be in the gutter,

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:28.200
it's more fitting
that you talk in the bathroom!

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:31.040
Ack! Hoshino.

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:43.290
Th-That's the Iron Maiden for you,
Kirara Hoshino,

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:48.950
the ultra-germophobe who won't touch
anything a guy has touched with her bare hands.

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:55.660
And yet, because she's so hot, she's got
piles of teen boy corpses at her feet.

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:58.290
Such a pity that you're
her childhood friend, Retto,

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:00.750
since not even you have a chance.

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.950
O-Oh, well.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:06.160
Still, Kirara's changed.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.200
She always played with the boys
in grade school.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:13.790
She probably had a bitter experience
with dirty-minded boys.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:18.160
It's true. One day, Hoshino just changed.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:23.410
She used to be more outgoing.

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:26.540
We'd take detours
while walking home from school together.

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:31.080
When the two of us were alone,
she would often tease me.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:34.500
But that's the Hoshino I loved.

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:45.540
Ms. Hoshino!

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.660
You have class duty today, right?

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:52.790
Would you carry these notebooks
to the staff room?

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.660
Sure, no problem.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:07.000
"BOYS"        "GIRLS"

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:14.370
If it's that disagreeable,
how about I give you a hand?

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:19.370
After all, I'm sure you don't want
to touch the boys' notebooks, right?

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.040
Enjo...

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:28.040
Do as you please.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:37.080
Just so you know, you'd better stay at
least one meter away from me at all times.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:40.040
Yeah, yeah.

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:42.370
What else is new?

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.040
Listen.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:55.580
Don't worry about what other people think.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:05:00.200
No matter how much you've changed,
you're still you, Hoshino...

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:01.450
Like old times...

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:04.120
What's that?

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:07.250
You make it sound
like I forced myself to change.

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:11.000
N-No. I didn't mean it like that.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:16.040
Then how did you mean it?

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:20.580
As far as I'm concerned,
I haven't changed.

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:24.080
You don't know anything about me.

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:27.910
Just because we used to be friends,
don't talk like you know me now!

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:33.500
I don't need your help if it's
just an excuse to lay that stuff on me!

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.540
Watch it!

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:58.000
Sorry, Hoshino!
My hand suddenly shot out!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.830
I swear, it wasn't on purpose!

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:04.290
H-Hoshino?

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:20.450
What does he want?

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:29.330
The reason Hoshino changed
is a secret between us.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:30.410
The reason is...

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:34.870
We interrupt your regularly scheduled
programming with breaking news.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:41.410
A superhuman
has suddenly appeared in Saitama.

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:48.330
For five years now, the city has been
shaken up by the superhuman Kiseishuu.

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:51.200
Doctor, what can you tell us?

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:57.000
Frankly speaking,
the Kiseishuu are not humans.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:00.790
They're aliens who invaded Earth years ago.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:05.120
They eliminate things
that make humans feel sexual desire

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:09.660
and use any means necessary
to absorb the wellspring of human desire,

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:12.040
known as "H-Energy"!

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:17.200
If this goes on, the birthrate will continue
to plummet until the human race dies out!

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.500
P-Please calm down, Doctor!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:23.080
Anyway, it's extremely dangerous,

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:26.160
for humans who are stripped of H-Energy
lose the will to live!

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:29.830
I implore everyone
to steer clear of the Kiseishuu.

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:34.250
Thank you for coming today, everyone!

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:36.910
I promise I'll make it worth your while!

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:39.700
--Yeah!
--I'm your biggest fan!

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:43.580
It looks like your cheers of encouragement

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:46.700
have made one of the costumed characters
curious enough to come over.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.370
Thank you for coming, too!

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:54.790
The males come in droves
for a small number of females.

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:59.250
Humans are such illogical creatures.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:02.290
And now for my first song--

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:12.040
I saw!

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:13.790
But they were glowing.

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:15.200
Did you get it on video?

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.790
Of course!

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:26.330
What am I doing?
College entrance exams are this year.

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:27.450
I have to get to the office.

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:30.790
Huh? What's gotten into everyone?

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:32.330
My secret--

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:42.120
Maybe I'll look for a real job.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:51.410
In the end, if you steal human desire,
all they're left with is an empty shell!

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:57.870
Looks like there's one straggler.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:04.450
Just like that one day!

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:08.910
How many humans
have you robbed of their emotions?

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:15.370
From now on, you and your kind
are done with my planet!

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:19.870
Humans say the most amusing things.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:23.950
Maybe I'll absorb your energy, too!

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:31.580
My absolute favorite is the rich,
full-bodied H-Energy of puberty!

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.620
I see.

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:38.120
But first, eat this!

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:40.200
Hoshino changed...

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:41.790
...and it's all...

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:46.950
...because of you, Kiseishuu!

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:51.700
I-It can't be!

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:54.700
How could a mere human do this to me?

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:58.410
What... is he?

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:02.910
And that's how
I started exterminating Kiseishuu!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:06.290
I'm a high school student and a hero!

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:21.500
"EARTH DEFENSE FORCE
SAITAMA BRANCH"

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.500
"MATERIALS ROOM"

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:26.080
"EARTH DEFENSE FORCE
SAITAMA BRANCH
HERO DIVISION"
Would you do something about this, already?

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:29.660
Every time I beat an Kiseishuu,
my clothes get trashed.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:33.160
It's a pain having to walk around
with a spare set wherever I go.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:35.580
That can't be helped, Retto.

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:39.580
The XERO gear
can only enhance your strength.

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:42.040
I know, but put yourself in my place,

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.950
left standing nude
in the middle of town every time.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:50.790
But is it really all that embarrassing?

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:54.450
Well, I guess I'd be more embarrassed
if I were dressed like you.

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:55.700
Oh?

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:09.750
Here. This is good to go, Retto.

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:11.870
Great. Thanks.

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:18.330
Oh, by the way, what ever happened
to getting another member?

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:22.160
I'm still searching for candidates.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:26.500
I haven't been able to find
someone with potential like you.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:29.750
Why don't you just do it yourself, Uncle?

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:30.950
Yeah, right!

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:39.040
The XERO gear converts
the user's erotic energy into power.

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:42.620
Teenagers like you
are going through an emotional period,

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:45.160
so it's most effective for you.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:48.080
It's a different story
for an old man like me.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:53.040
Besides, you want to make the Kiseishuu
pay for changing that girl, don't you?

00:11:54.910 --> 00:12:00.410
True. That's the reason
I'm helping like this.

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:07.700
But I know that the old Hoshino
will never come back.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:11.620
Still, I made up my mind.

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:15.450
I won't let them
make anyone else feel this way!

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:21.200
Even if she rejects me,
Hoshino was my precious first love.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:25.660
I'll apologize to her tomorrow.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:38.660
Hoshino! I'm sorry about yesterday!

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.330
H-Hey, Hoshino...

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:50.200
I said I'm sorry about yesterday!

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:53.160
What are you gawking at, boy?

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:55.950
N-Nothin'!

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:56.700
Um...

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:57.620
Good morning.

00:12:57.620 --> 00:12:59.410
Good morning, Kirara.

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:02.540
Did you do the Japanese homework?

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:06.250
Of course.
But I'm not going to let you copy.

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:09.870
Hoshino deleted me
from her consciousness!

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:11.750
H-Hoshino.

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:13.790
Hoshino!

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:16.080
Hoshino...

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:26.120
Somebody once said that the opposite
of love isn't hate, but indifference.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.950
I-I get it.

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:41.120
You don't have to answer me,
and you don't need to forgive me.

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:44.040
Just listen to me for a second!

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:48.290
I honestly don't care
if you've changed or not.

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:52.540
Even if you don't want to remember
what happened a long time ago...

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.500
But back then, I was in--

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:02.870
I found you, human!

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.950
The Kiseishuu from yesterday!

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:16.000
It's okay, Hoshino. Just get back!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:21.200
Come and get me, Kiseishuu!

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:24.450
I'll never let your kind
touch Hoshino again!

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:31.540
Enjo?

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:36.410
I don't have enough energy
after expending it yesterday?

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:42.660
It seems you're weaker today.

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:47.000
Then you can suck your thumb and watch

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:53.580
as I absorb the energy of humans in town
with this new body, given to me by the queen!

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.410
I'll begin with...

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:58.910
...the energy from that female behind you!

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:01.410
Hey! What is this?

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:03.040
Let's get out of here, Hoshino!

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.160
O-Okay!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:12.370
Huh? What is this feeling?

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:16.660
Despite the circumstances,
it feels really...

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:33.040
Enjo, our hands...

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.700
S-Sorry! I did it again.

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.000
Not that.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:41.330
I'll let you get away with it just for today,

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:45.040
s-so hold my hand a little longer.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:47.790
S-Sure.

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.620
This feeling...

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:05.200
How many years has it been?

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:10.330
Enjo's hand is bigger than I thought.

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:17.330
It's rough, and I can feel
how warm he is through it.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:21.950
So this is what a boy's hand feels like.

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:26.830
All this time, I haven't touched one.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:32.370
Maybe because of that,
I've become especially sensitive to boys.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:37.120
But touching bare hand to bare hand...

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:42.910
...in a way, it's the same thing
as a naked embrace, isn't it?

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:47.500
I can't hold back!

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:52.370
My sealed heart has opened up wide!

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:02.950
Wh-What is this?

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:05.750
I've never seen it before, either.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:09.290
Don't tell me this is Hoshino's energy.

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:16.450
I found you!

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:23.500
Be resigned to your fate, humans!

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:26.540
Sh-She's huge!

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:29.080
After draining people in town?

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:34.870
Wh-What's she going to do?

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:37.080
I'll explain the reasoning later...

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:41.450
...but for now...

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:42.870
...let's kick her ass!

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:02.250
Th-That was awesome, Hoshino!

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:04.620
We beat that giant Kiseishuu
with one attack!

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:20.120
Eeek!

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:24.080
What do we do now?

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:28.000
M-My bad. I dragged you into this.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:31.700
But you were a huge help.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:39.540
That's right. He's been fighting
all this time, and I didn't know it.

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:45.450
He's been fighting the monsters
that attacked us that day.

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:46.580
Are you all right?

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:50.200
I think she did something to you!

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:54.790
No, I'm fine. Just a little surprised.

00:18:54.790 --> 00:18:57.120
Th-That's impossible!

00:18:57.120 --> 00:19:02.790
How can she be unfazed
after I absorbed so much of her energy?

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:06.290
How erotic can one human being be?!

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:08.500
She has many times more
than an average person.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.910
Dozens of times more!
No, even more than that!

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:17.080
What must you be thinking about
to produce so much erotic energy?

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:20.910
More than even I can absorb!

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:24.700
This human can't be neutered!

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:30.620
H-Hoshino.

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:33.700
She's wrong!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:43.540
And so I locked up my heart
and began rejecting boys.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:50.120
But if I can get back
to the way things were, then...

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:59.330
W-Well...

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:06.870
...how about I help you
with what you do, Ret?

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:15.870
Th-That's only if you promise not to tell
anyone about what happened today.

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:18.700
Wait. That aside, Hoshino...

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.870
You just called me Ret...

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:27.500
N-Never mind. Sorry.
Forget I said anything.

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:29.750
Yeah, but you did just...

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:37.580
Enjo-Enjo-Enjo-Enjo-Enjo-Enjo-Enjo-
Enjo-Enjo-Enjo-Enjo-Enjo-Enjo-Enjo!

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:40.700
Y-You must have misheard me!

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.500
Y-Yeah.

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:46.000
What's the idea of flirting in public
in your birthday suit?

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:49.290
Y-You three?

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:53.080
Sheesh. We thought a giant Kiseishuu
was on the loose,

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:55.910
so we came running, only to find...

00:20:57.370 --> 00:20:59.410
This girl is Yellow?

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:03.250
She certainly has the erotic body for it.

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:07.660
Th-That's no way to talk about someone
you're meeting for the first time, Momoka.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:10.620
Wh-Who are these people?

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:11.870
Oof.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.660
Here.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:16.870
Get dressed before a crowd forms.

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:18.750
Th-Thank you.

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:21.580
And this is your key.

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:25.370
Excuse me?

00:21:25.370 --> 00:21:27.120
Don't give me, "Excuse me."

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:31.330
Didn't you hear that all the members
of Super HxEros live together?

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:34.250
